  ('Black Samson', 'Any Character', 'SKY', 'Ambush! Acts as a level 6 Brute Force attack. If successful, target character may not play Special cards for remainder of battle. May only have 1 "Ambush!" card per deck.', 'sky/specials/354_black_samson.png', TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, ARRAY[]::text[], 6, '354', NULL, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, 'Uncommon'),
