  ('Darkwing', 'Any Character', 'SKY', 'Ambush! Acts as a level 5 Combat attack. If successful, target character must discard 2 cards of Opponent''s choice. Cards must be placed to target or in hand. May only have 1 "Ambush!" card per deck.', 'sky/specials/356_darkwing.png', TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, ARRAY[]::text[], 5, '356', NULL, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, 'Uncommon'),
